   "replyText": "Nice sentence! \"My birthday is in May\" is correct — we use \"in\" with months. I'm putting a small picture of a calendar on the screen to help.\n\nNow try this one: how would you say your friend's birthday if it's on a specific day, like May fifth? Which little word goes before the day?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "I am nine years old.",
   "startT": 25700,
   "endT": 28307,
   "audioSec": 2.61,
   "replyAudioLatencyMs": 2283,
   "replyTextEventLatencyMs": 2128,
   "heard": "I am nine years old.",
   "heardMessages": 1,
   "transcriptLatencyMs": -60,
   "queries": [
    {
     "status": 200,
     "firstContentMs": 1401,
     "totalMs": 2553,
     "chars": 266
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Good, that's correct! We say \"I am nine years old,\" no \"years\" of trouble there. Nice clear sentence.\n\nLet's build on it. Look at the calendar still on the screen. If I ask how old your friend is and she's the same age, how would you tell me her age in one sentence?"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "I want a big cake.",
   "startT": 46136,
   "endT": 48978,
   "audioSec": 2.84,
   "replyAudioLatencyMs": 2092,
   "replyTextEventLatencyMs": 1934,
   "heard": "I want a big cake.",
   "heardMessages": 1,
   "transcriptLatencyMs": -50,
   "queries": [
    {
     "status": 200,
     "firstContentMs": 1398,
     "totalMs": 2193,
     "chars": 224
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Nice, that works! \"I want a big cake\" is a clear sentence.\n\nNow, back to my question. Your friend is the same age as you. Using \"she,\" how would you say her age in one sentence? Think about the word that changes from \"I am.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "My friends come to my party.",
   "startT": 66411,
   "endT": 69713,
   "audioSec": 3.3,
   "replyAudioLatencyMs": 2657,
   "replyTextEventLatencyMs": 2478,
   "heard": "I friends come to my party.",
