     "firstContentMs": 1658,
     "totalMs": 2767,
     "chars": 288
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Almost! One small thing missing: after \"I\", we need the verb \"have\". Try saying it again: \"I have friends come to my party\"... actually, better is \"My friends come to my party.\"\n\nSo let's fix the start. Instead of \"I friends,\" we say \"My friends.\" Can you say the whole sentence that way?"
  }
